  "nutrition": null,
  "importedNotes": [
    {
      "text": "I added a bit of sugar to cut the acidity of both lemon and tomatoes. Makes a thin sauce that goes great with pasta and adds a hint of lemon."
    },
    {
      "text": "I thought that this recipe was great! I cut up fresh cherry tomatoes that I put around the chicken on a plate. Tasty and looks appetizing too."
    }
